   "file": "teleporter/32648.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Update Announcer: I provide the latest news from areas throughout the continent. Need information on a newly discovered relic or just-opened hunting grounds? Come see me! Knowledge is power, after all... We do charge a fee to move you to one of the areas in the news.",
